None of that is in the "Bank holds rates" headline. For anyone with variable-rate debt, a mortgage renewing in the next six months, or fixed-income investments rolling over, the detail matters more than the headline.<br><br>
I work with clients to translate these decisions into the implications for their specific situation. If this is the kind of context you''d find useful on a regular basis, I''d be glad to connect.<br><br>
